window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Sitting on the side of the road, Zoe wonders, </b><b><i>“Where do I go from here?”</i></b><br> <br> While heading home from the newsroom Zoe Fontaine was in a near fatal accident.<br> One that has left her battling anxiety and bouts of paranoia.<br> <br> In need of a refuge to give her a sense of peace and belonging,<br> she rents a place on the edge of Sapphire Valley.<br> But when strange deaths spring up across town,<br> Zoe’s editor assigns her to investigate the gruesome, bizarre cases.<br> <br> As Zoe attempts to make sense of the crimes and her own troubled past,<br> she runs into Leo Rowden, a veterinarian who runs a local clinic on the other side of town.<br> Leo is riddled with painful memories and haunting nightmares of his own,<br> struggling with PTSD from his military days and coping with the loss of his fiancée.<br> <br> When Leo is asked to assist on the case, they uncover a twisted trail that stretches for miles.<br> Could these incidents be connected to the sinister crimes gripping the town?</p> <p><b><i>Strange coincidences and murders are converging in Sapphire Valley.<br> Determined to solve the town’s mysteries and overcome the nightmares of their pasts, they find themselves embarking on a journey that will forever change their lives.</i></b></p>"; 
